---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.vue';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.vue';
import { getTranslations } from '../../i18n';

const t = getTranslations('en');
const currentLocale = 'en';
const buildDate = new Date().toISOString();
const lastUpdatedFormatted = new Date(buildDate).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  day: 'numeric'
});
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy | RedPulse Innovations"
  description="RedPulse Innovations privacy policy — how we process personal data in line with GDPR."
  lang="en"
>
  <Header t={t} currentLocale={currentLocale} basePath="/en/" client:load />
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="legal-header">
        <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdatedFormatted}</p>
      </header>

      <article class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
          <p>
            The controller of your personal data is
            <strong>RedPulse Innovations Dawid Adamski</strong>, based at
            al. Ratuszowa 14 lok. 2, 88-100 Inowrocław, Kuyavian-Pomeranian Voivodeship, Poland,
            Tax ID (NIP): <strong>5562805527</strong>,
            Business registry (REGON): <strong>526676500</strong>
            (hereinafter: "Controller" or "RedPulse Innovations").
          </p>
          <p>
            For any matters related to personal data processing you can reach us at
            <a href="mailto:kontakt@redpulse.tech">kontakt@redpulse.tech</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Scope of collected data</h2>
          <p>We only collect data necessary to deliver our services:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Contact data</strong> — when you email
              <a href="mailto:kontakt@redpulse.tech">kontakt@redpulse.tech</a> or
              book a consultation through Calendly: first name, last name, email,
              optionally company name and message content.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Server log technical data</strong> — standard nginx access
              logs (IP address, User-Agent, requested URL, date and time, response
              code). Logs are not written to a file — they go to the Docker
              container's stdout and are kept only within the container's
              lifecycle. They are discarded on the next deployment or container
              restart. They are not exported, not analyzed with any analytics
              tools, and not combined with other data. We use them only for
              ad-hoc security and stability diagnostics.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Purposes and legal basis for processing</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Answering inquiries / running consultations</strong> —
              Article 6(1)(b) GDPR (performance of a contract or pre-contractual steps).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Direct marketing of our own services</strong> —
              Article 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest of the Controller).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Compliance with legal obligations</strong> (accounting, tax) —
              Article 6(1)(c) GDPR.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Recipients of data</h2>
          <p>Your data may be shared with trusted processors:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Calendly, Inc.</strong> — scheduling service
              (server in the USA, transfer based on Standard Contractual Clauses).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>mikr.us</strong> — service operated by
              UW-TEAM.ORG Jakub Mrugalski (Polish tax ID 6821639338, Słomniki,
              Poland); hosting of the website and email inbox. Servers are
              physically located in Finland (Helsinki), i.e. within the
              European Economic Area.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>LinkedIn Ireland Unlimited Company</strong> — if you contact
              us via LinkedIn.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            With each processor we have a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) in place
            as required by Article 28 GDPR.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Retention period</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Inquiry data that did not lead to an engagement — up to 12 months.</li>
            <li>Client data — for the duration of the contract and 6 years afterwards (tax obligations).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
          <p>Regarding our processing of your data you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>access your data and obtain a copy,</li>
            <li>rectify inaccurate data,</li>
            <li>erase your data ("right to be forgotten"),</li>
            <li>restrict processing,</li>
            <li>data portability,</li>
            <li>object to processing,</li>
            <li>withdraw consent at any time (without affecting the lawfulness of processing before withdrawal),</li>
            <li>lodge a complaint with the Polish Data Protection Authority (uodo.gov.pl).</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            To exercise these rights, email us at
            <a href="mailto:kontakt@redpulse.tech">kontakt@redpulse.tech</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            This site uses only <strong>strictly necessary cookies</strong> required
            for the site to work (e.g., remembering your cookie choice). They do
            not require consent and are not used for profiling.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>We currently do not use</strong> any analytics or marketing
            cookies. If we introduce them in the future, we will update this
            policy and ask for your consent through the cookie banner — you will
            be able to withdraw it at any time from the cookie settings available
            in the footer.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Data transfers outside the EEA</h2>
          <p>
            Most of your data is processed in Poland (by RedPulse Innovations)
            and in Finland (mikr.us hosting servers) — both locations are within
            the European Economic Area, so full GDPR guarantees apply.
          </p>
          <p>
            The exception is <strong>Calendly, Inc.</strong>, based in the USA.
            For that transfer outside the EEA we rely on Standard Contractual
            Clauses approved by the European Commission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Automated decision-making</h2>
          <p>
            We do not make automated decisions or profile you in ways that significantly
            affect your legal situation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            This policy may be updated. The current version with the last update date
            is always available at
            <a href="/en/privacy-policy">redpulse.tech/en/privacy-policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer t={t} lastUpdated={buildDate} locale={currentLocale} basePath="/en/" client:load />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .legal-header {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .legal-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--gray-500);
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--gray-800);
  }

  .legal-content section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--red-500);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: var(--red-600, #b91c1c);
  }
</style>
